    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), choose a **DRUKHARI** unit of yours that you haven’t picked to fight this phase. Its models get +1 to [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) through phase end. If those attacks kill your [Contract](vsdata:ability/drukhari.kabalite-cartel.murderous-agenda) unit, the opponent’s entire army takes [Battle-shock tests](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock). Failures from these tests can give you at most 3 [Pain tokens](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain) total.",
